{
  "info": {
    "name": "MiniBank - Testes no Bruno",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Importe no Bruno como Postman Collection, com conversão de scripts habilitada (Preserve scripts desmarcado). API e PostgreSQL devem estar em execução, com migrations aplicadas. Execute as 17 requisições na ordem, sem paralelismo. A primeira inicia uma nova rodada e os scripts capturam IDs automaticamente. Saldo final: origem 74.50, destino 25.50. Cada rodada cria duas contas persistentes. Repetir apenas o depósito altera o saldo. baseUrl pode ser ajustada nas variáveis da coleção. Não há autenticação nesta API."
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5032",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "execucao",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "contaOrigemId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "contaDestinoId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "chaveTransferencia",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "operacaoId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Criar conta origem",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/contas",
        "description": "Inicia uma nova execução com números e chave únicos. Execute toda a coleção em ordem, sem paralelismo.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"numero\": \"bruno-origem-{{execucao}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const execucao = Date.now().toString() + \"-\" + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 10);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"execucao\", execucao);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"chaveTransferencia\", \"bruno-\" + execucao);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"contaOrigemId\", \"\");",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"contaDestinoId\", \"\");",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"operacaoId\", \"\");"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 201\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"contaOrigemId\", pm.response.json().id); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Criar conta destino",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/contas",
        "description": "",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"numero\": \"bruno-destino-{{execucao}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 201\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"contaDestinoId\", pm.response.json().id); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - Listar contas",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/contas",
        "description": ""
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "04 - Depositar 100 na origem",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/contas/{{contaOrigemId}}/depositos",
        "description": "Execute uma vez por rodada. Depósitos não são idempotentes: repetir acrescenta mais 100 ao saldo.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"valor\": 100\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "05 - Transferir 25.50",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Idempotency-Key",
            "value": "{{chaveTransferencia}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/transferencias",
        "description": "",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"contaOrigemId\": \"{{contaOrigemId}}\",\n  \"contaDestinoId\": \"{{contaDestinoId}}\",\n  \"valor\": 25.5\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"operacaoId\", pm.response.json().id); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "06 - Repetir transferência sem duplicar",
